@* App: the HTML shell and root component of the ReviewCenter web UI.

   This is static server-side rendered markup: it emits the document skeleton, the router that
   selects a page for the requested URL, and the Blazor client script that upgrades interactive
   pages to a live server connection. Pages opt in to interactivity individually (see HomePage),
   so everything outside a page stays cheap, static HTML. *@
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>
<body>
    <Routes />
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
